SUMMARY:Little Things\, by Hand
DESCRIPTION:This hands-on workshop teaches participants to craft their own keychains from natural palm leaf. Using simple\, sustainable materials and traditional hand techniques\, participants replace factory-made\, mass-produced objects with something made entirely by your own hands. Can the things we carry leave no waste? \nBeyond the craft itself\, the session is an invitation to rethink everyday consumption\, one small\, handmade object at a time. Finished keychains make thoughtful gifts as well as personal keepsakes\, carrying the message forward to friends and family. All materials provided and participants take their creations home. \nIn Collaboration with: \n \nVenue: Board Room\n\n\nMake Your Own Palm Leaf Keychains\nFor Ages 10+\nRSVPs closed. Thank you for your interest.\n*Facilitator*: Azarudeen\n*Event Categories*: Heritage\, Sustainability\, Workshops
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/little-things-by-hand/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Heritage,Sustainability,Workshops
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/ThumbnailLTBH.jpg
END:VEVENT
